<p. 1a> śrīgurubhyo namaḥ || 
śrīmahālakṣmī devyai || 
[athamahādīpacchoyarkayā pūjāvidhi likhyate] || 
petavāsanamālakocoya vidhithyaṃ jiyake || 
yajamānapuṣpabhājanaṃ || adyādi || vākya || 
mānavagotrayajamānasya śrī śrī jayarūpatīndramallavarvaṇa śrīśrīśrī mahālakṣmī 
devatā prītyarthaṃ || 
viśvajātrāmahādīpa prajvālita pañcopacārapūjākatuṃ puṣpabhājanaṃ 
samarpayāmi || 
śrīsamvartā maṇḍalānte kramapadanihitā nandaśaktiḥ subhīmāsṛṣṭaṃ 
nyāyacatuṣkaṃ akulakulagataṃ paṃcakaṃ cānya ṣaṭkaṃ |

<p. 1b> catvāraḥ pañcakonyaṃ punarapicaturaṃ tatvato maṇḍalena saṃsṛṣṭaṃ yena 
tasmainamanaguruvaraṃ bhairavaśrīkujeśa || 
vrahmāṇīkamalendu saumyavadanī māheśvarī lirayā kaumārī ripudarghanāsanakarī 
cakrāyudhā vaiṣṇavī || 
vārāhīghanaghora gharghanamukhī endrī ca vajrāyudhā cāmuṇḍāgaṇanātha bhairava 
gaṇārakṣantume mātṛkā || 
śyāmāraktāninetrā stanabharaṇamitāmattamāṭaṃ gagāmi vimvosthicārunetrā pṛthuta 
rajaṃghanāmekharāratna sobhe || devāgevayusobhe varavarakusume varvare keśabhāre 
sāmeśrīkubjikākhyā vitaratutarasājñānadi vyoghamogha || 
<p. 2a> utphullāmvujakarṇikopari | gatāśrīsiddhilakṣmī parākarpūre 
sphaṭikendukuṇḍadhavarāniśrekapāpopahā | 
saṃsārātnavaduḥkha paṃkajaharinīskampamaṃ sarvadā śrīmatpañcamukhāmvujā 
daśabhujāpreta sthitāpātuva || 
saundaryasāraruvirāṃ kamalāyatākṣīṃ pīnastanīṃ lalitahārasuśobha mānā | 
khaḍga triśūlavaradābhayapāṇi rūpāṃ lakṣmīṃ namāmiśirasāmahanīñca 
mūrtiṃ || 

<p. 2b> siddhirayūkriyārambhe vṛddhirayūdhanāgame | 
puṣṭhirayūśarīreṣu śāntirayūgṛhetava | 
sarvavighnipraśamanaṃ sarvaśāntikaraṃ śubhaṃ | 
āyuḥ putravakāmaṃ ca lakṣmīḥ santativardhanaṃ yathā vānaprahārāṇāṃ kavacaṃ 
bhava tu vāraṇaṃ tadvadevavidhātrāṇāṃ śāntibhava tu vāraṇaṃ || 
puṣpabhājanaṃ samappayāmiḥ || gurunamaskāla || 
aiṁ (5) hrāṁ ātmatatvāya svāhā || ai (5) hrīṁ vidyātatvāyasvāhā || ai (5) hūṁ śivatatvāya 
svāhā || ai (5) akhaṇḍamaṇḍalākāraṃ vyāptaṃ yena carācaraṃ | 
tat padaṃ daśitaṃ yena tasmai śrīguruvenamaḥ ||

<p. 3a> aiṁ (5) guruvahmāguruviṣṇugurudeva maheśvaraṃ | 
gurudevajagatsarvaṃ tasmaiśrīguruvenamaḥ || paramagurubhyo namaḥ || parameṣṭhī 
gurubhyo namaḥ || paramācārya gurubhyo namaḥ || vali || padmāsanāya namaḥ || thavake 
kūrmāsanāya pādukāṃ || nyāsa || 
aiṁ (5) hūṁ phaṭ vajrapaṃjare svāhā || calamakule kulamacare hrīṁ hrūṁ phaṭ svāhā || maṁ 
astrāya phaṭ || karaśodhanaṃ || māṁ kaniṣṭhāya namaḥ || mīṁ anāmikāya svāhā || mūṁ 
madhyemāyavoṣaṭ || maiṁ tarjanyāya hūṁ || mauṁ aṅgaṣṭhāya vaṣaṭ || maṁ astrāya phaṭ ||
<p. 3b> māṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || mīṁ śirase svāhā || mūṁ śikhāya vauṣaṭ || maiṁ kavacāya 
hūṁ || mauṁ netratrayāyavaṣaṭ || maṁ astrāyaphaṭ || jalapātrapūjā || aiṁ (5) hrīṁ 
jalapātrāsanāya pādukāṃ || aiṁ (5) hskṣmlvryūṁ ānandaśakti bhairavānanda 
vīrādhīpataye ydkṣmlvryīṁ śrījalapātrabhaṭṭārikāya pādukāṃ || ṣaḍaṃga || māṁ 
hṛdayāya namaḥ || māṁ śirase svāhā || muṁ śikhāya vauṣaṭ || maiṁ kavacāya hūṁ || mauṁ 
netratrayāyavaṣaṭ || maṁ || astrāya phaṭ || āvāhanādi || dhenumudrāṃ darśayet || yrtrī|| aiṁ 
(5) mahālakṣmī vidmahesiṃhāsanāya dhīmahetannolakṣmī pracodayāt ||
<p. 4a> arghapātrapūjā || aiṁ (5) arghapātrāsanāya pādukau || aiṁ (5) hrāṁ hrīṁ hrūṁ hraḥ 
prasphura (2) ghora (2) taratanu (2) rūpavaṭ (2) pracaṭa (2) kaha (2) vama (2) dama (2) ghāṭaya (2) 
vighāṭaya (2) vighni (2) hūṁ 3 phaṭ krauṁ śrīmahākaumārivicce pādukāṃ || aiṁ (5) 
śkṣmlvryīṁ ānandaśaktibhairavānanda śrīmahāvidyārājeśvarī hskṣmlvryūṁ 
śrīarghapātrabhaṭṭārikāya pādukāṃ || ṣaḍaṃga || māṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || mīṁ śirase 
svāhā || muṁ śikhāya vauṣaṭ | maiṁ kavacāya hūṁ || mauṁ netratrayāya vaṣaṭ || 
<p. 4b> maḥ astrāya phaṭ || āvāhanādi || yonimudrāṃ darśayet || bhūtaśuddhi || aiṁ hrīṁ 
śrīṁ hsphreṁ hskauṁ hskauḥ hskauḥ hsphreṁ śrīṁ hrīṁ aiṁ || ātmapūjā || aiṁ caṇḍanaṃ 
pādukāṃ || hrīṁ akṣataṃ pādukāṃ || śrīṁ vīrabhasmaṃ pādukāṃ || hsphreṁ sarva 
janamohanī pādukāṃ || hskauṁ nānācchatrālaṃkālapuṣpaṃ pādukāṃ || aiṁ kuśau 
pādukāṃ || 3 || tāhāraṣo pūjā || oṃ gaṃgāyai namaḥ || oṃ yamuyai namaḥ || oṃ 
narmadāyai namaḥ || oṃ kauśakti namaḥ || oṃ gaṇḍakī namaḥ || oṃ sarayu namaḥ || 
<p. 5a> oṃ saptasamudrebhyo namaḥ || oṃ saṃpūrṇakaraṇāyai namaḥ || aiṁ (5) hskṣmlvryūṁ 
kulavṛkṣamahāsena saṃmohanasakalatīrthamantradevatā kalā tatvādhipataye 
vrahmaviṣṇurudrātmane ātmavidyā śivatatvāyai hskṣmlvryūṁ saṃpūrṇakalasa murtaye 
pādukāṃ || āvāhanādi || dhenumudrāṃ darśayet || devasnāna || adyādi || vākya || 
ūkāraṃ vāyuvījaṃ taduparivaruṇaṃ vajrapāṇintadūrddhaṃ kālaṃ varṇāntayuktaṃ 
tadupariparamaṃ vahnivījaṃ sahaṃsaṃ | 
<p. 5b> induṃ vinduṃ layāntaṃ śitakamalavaraṃ kṣīradhārāśravantaṃ dṛṣṭvā 
kuṭantunityaṃ dahatikulamalaṃ merutulyaṃ hi pāpaṃ || vudu || 
payasāmṛtapuna na pṛthivyāṃ paripūritaṃ | 
kāmadhyenu śravannityaṃ snāpayāmi śivājñayā || dhari || dadhiḍamāpatiṃ devaṃ 
devānāmati vallabhaṃ || 
vāṃccharkapaṭala sthānaṃ yena snānena labhyate || ghera || 
ghṛtaputaṃ vinākena liṅgapūtaṃ pinākiṇi | 
agniśakti svarūpeṇa tārtilokācanaṃ śivaṃ || kasti || 
gomukhī vipinobhūtaṃ devānāṃ priyamurtamaṃ | 

<p. 6a> vāṃcchākalpataru snānaṃ yena snānena labhyate || śākhaḍga || 
khaṇḍametan mahāsvādumanasāḥ śītalaṃ sadā | 
khaṇḍandu snāpitaṃ devaṃ akhaṇḍitavala pradā || paṃcāmṛta || 
tathā paṃcādi payasaṃ paṃcavrahmā nivāsinaṃ | 
paṃcadravya samāyuktaṃ paṃcāṅgaiḥ snāpayāmyahaṃ | 
alisnāna śkṣmlvryūṁ pādukaṃ || ceta ||
śrīkhaṇḍacandanaṃ divyaṃ gaṃdhādya svamanoharaṃ |
ābhūṣitaṃ lalātaṅge candanaṃ prati gṛhyatāṃ || 
candanaṃ llepitaṃ puṇyaṃ pavitraṃ pāpanāśanaṃ āpadāharate nityaṃ lakṣmīrājya 
sukhapradāṃ || 

<p. 6b> siṃdhara || vīreśvarī mahāvīra vīrabhasma vibhūṣitaṃ | 
trailokyā karṣaṇī devī siṃdulāruṇa murtamaṃ || akṣata || 
akṣataṃ akṣayokāmaṃ dharmakāmārtha siddhidaṃ | 
ispitemevaraṃ devī paratre ca parāṅgatiṃ || dṛṣṭi || 
dhyānadṛṣṭiviśāleṣu lalitaṃ vīra cakṣuṣu | 
somasūryāgnibhuvanṃ vai samaṃ netranirmalaṃ || jajamekā || 
jajñopavītaṃ paramaṃ pavitraṃ pajāpra tejasahaja purastāt āyuṣmagaṅdhaṃ 
pratimacaṇḍatraṃ yajñopavitaṃ paramamtu teja || aduvāra || 
nānāvastravicitrārgaṃ kṣaumakāryāsa nirmitaṃ | 

<p. 7a> devāṅgaṃ bhūṣaṇaśreṣṭhaṃ gṛhāṇa parameśvaraṃ || cacchumāḍhe || 
cchatraṃcintāmaṇiṃ divyaṃ pūrṇacandranibhaṃsitaṃ | 
tena dartenadeveśadehimecintitaṃ phalaṃ || svāna||
nānāpuṣpa sugandhādimāratī kusumodayaṃ saubhāgyasiddhidaṃ bhadrapuṣvārohana 
muttamaṃ || pañcapatākā || 
patākāpaṃcavarṇābhā karṇayoḥ parilamvinī | 
paṃcabhūtātmikā paṃcadartayaṃ kṣaumanirmitā || karṇapatākā || 
śurddhasiṃdulavarṇābhāṃ patākāṃ karṇasaṃjñakāṃ || 
gṛhāṇaparameśānacatuḥkoṇā suśobhanā | 

<p. 7b> śvatecchāyalaye pitacūrnanajā pūjā voyamālakvacoya || tritatvenācanaṃ || 
oṃ hrāṁ ātmatatvāya svāhā || oṃ hrāṁ vidyātatvāya svāhā || oṃ hrūṁ śivatatvāya svāhā 
|| sūryārgha || adyādi || vākya || 
varṇāntaṃ vijamuddhṛtya tasyopariśivaṃ nyaset || 
ādimadhyā vaśāne tu magnitraya vibhūṣitaṃ || 
varmaṇādipitaṃ kṛtvā sāvityā caiva mūrddharet | 
eṣakūtavaraḥ śreṣṭo mahāmārtaṇḍa bhairava || arghannamaḥ puṣpaṃ namaḥ || 
hrīṁ śrīmahāmārtaṇḍa bhairavāya namaḥ || gurunamaskāra || 
aiṁ (5) akhaṇḍakṣu maṇḍalākāraṃ vyāptaṃ yena carācaraṃ || 

<p. 8a> tat padaṃ darśitaṃ yena tasmai śrīguruve namaḥ || 
guruvrahmāguruviṣṇugurudeva maheśvara || 
gurudevajagat sarvaṃ tasmai śrīguruve namaḥ || paramagurubhyo namaḥ || parameṣṭhī 
gurubhyo namaḥ || paramācāryagurubhyo namaḥ || valisaḥ || padmāsanāya namaḥ || 
thavakaṃ kurmāsanāya namaḥ || 
huṁ phaṭ vajrapañjare svāhā || darśadvāraparśanaṃ || aiṁ (5) calamakulekulamacale hrāṁ 
hūṁ phaṭ svāhā || 
nyāstabhyamaṃ astrāya phaṭ | karaśodhanaṃ || māṁ kaniṣṭobhyāṃ namaḥ || mīṁ 
anāmikābhyāṃ svāhā || mūṁ madhyemāyabhyāṃ nama || 
<p. 8b> maiṁ tarjanībhyāṃ hūṁ | aiṁ (5) mauṁ aṃguṣṭhābhyāṃ namaḥ || maṁ 
kalatarapṛṭābhyāṃ namaḥ || aiṁ (5) māṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || aiṁ (5) mīṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || aiṁ 
mīṁ sirase svāhā || aiṁ (5) mūṁ śikhāyai vauṣaṭ || aiṁ (5) mai kavacāya hūṁ || aiṁ (5) mauṁ 
netratrayāya vaṣaṭ || maḥ astrāya phaṭ || jalapātrapūjā || aiṁ (5) jalapātrāṃsanāya 
pādukāṃ || aiṁ (5) hskṣmlvryūṁ ānandaśaktibhairavānanda vīrādhipataye yvkṣmlvryīṁ 
śrījalapātrabhaṭṭārikāya pādukāṃ || ṣaḍaṃga || māṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ ||
<p. 9a> mī śirase svāhā || mūṁ śikhāya vauṣaṭ || maiṁ kavacāya hūṁ || mauṁ netratrayāya 
vaṣaṭ || maṁ astrāya phaṭ || āvāhanādi || dhenumudrāṃ darśayet || gāyatrī || aiṁ (5) 
mahālakṣmīrvidmahe siṃhāsanāya dhīmahetannolakṣmī pracodayāt || arghapātrapūjā 
|| arghapātrāsanāya pādukāṃ || aiṁ (5) hrāṁ hrīṁ hrūṁ hraḥ prasphura (2) ghora (2) taratanu (2) 
rūpacaṭa (2) pracaṭa (2) kaha (2) vama (2) dama (2) ghātaya (2) vighātaya (2) vighni (2) hūṁ 3 phaṭ krauṁ 
śrīmahākaumārikā vicce pādukāṃ || ydkṣmlvryīṁ ānandaśaktibhairavānanda 
śrīmahāvidyārājeśvarī hskṣmlvryūṁ śrīarghapātra bhaṭṭārikāyai pādukāṃ || 
<p. 9b> ṣaḍaṃga || māṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || aiṁ (5) mīṁ śirase svāhā || aiṁ (5) mūṁ śikhāya 
vauṣaṭ || aiṁ (5) maiṁ kavacāya hūṃ || aiṁ (5) mauṁ netratrayāya vaṣaṭ || aiṁ (5) maṁ astrāya phaṭ || 
āvāhanādi || yonimudrāṃ darśayet || bhūtaśuddhi || aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ hsphreṁ hskauṁ hskauṁ 
hsphreṁ śrīṁ hrīṁ aiṁ || ātmapūjā || aiṁ candanaṃ pādukāṃ || hrīṁ akṣataṃ pādukāṃ || 
śrīṁ vīrabhasmaṃ pādukāṃ || hsphreṁ sarvajanamohanī pādukāṃ || hskauṁ nānācchatrā 
laṃkālapuṣpaṃ pādukāṃ || ai (5) hskṣmlvryūṁ ānandaśakti bhairavānanda 
vīrādhipataye śkṣmlvryīṁ ātmanepuṣpaṃ pādukāṃ ||
<p. 10> aiṁ (5) kusauṁ pādukāṃ 3 || mālatidaṇḍakaṃ paṭhet || oṃ namaścaṇḍikāyai || śrī 
bhairava uvāca || 
aiṁ (5) yatvaṃ mālinī devī nirmalemala nāśinī || 
jñānaśaktiprabhūddevī vuddhistvaṃteja varddhanī || 
janani sarva bhūtānāṃ saṃsāre'smin vyavasthitā || 
mātāvīrāvalidevī kāruṇyaṃ kulavatsale || 
jayatiparama tatvanirvāṇa saṃbhūtitejomayīḥ nisṛtāvyaktarūpā 
parājñānaśaktistvaṃ micchākriyāmaṅgalā ṛjvirekhāpunaḥ suptanāgendra 
vatkuṇḍalākārarūpā prabhūrnādaśaktistusaṃgīyase bhāsurājyotirūpāsvarūpā 
prabhurnādaśaktistu saṃgīyase bhāsurajyotirūpāsvarūpāṇi vājyeṣṭhaṃ nāmā ca 
vāmā ca raudrīmanākhyāvikā vindurūpā vadhutārddhacandrākṛtatvaṃ tikoṇā 
aḍamakāra īkara saṃjyonaikatva māpadyasenastvaṃ rūpābhagākāra vasthāyinī 
āditaḥ kṣāntatva bhavāyonisvarūpā śrīkaṇṭhasaṃvodhanī rudramātā tathā 
nantaśaktiḥ suśukṣmātrimurtya marīśārghinī bhārabhūtistithi śātmikā 
sthāṇubhūtāharākṣā ca ṛṃthiśabhautīśa sa śadyātmikā 
<p. 11> nugrahaśārcitātvaṃ krālaśārgaṃ mahāsena saṃbhoginī ṣoḍaśāntā 
mṛtāvindusaṃdohaniḥ syaṃ dehaplutā śeṣaśamyaka parānirvāṇa saukhyaprade 
bhairavībhairavodyāna krīḍānu śaktiḥ parāmālinī rudramātācitaṃ rudraśaktiḥ khagī 
siddhiyogeśvarī siddhimātāṃ vibhuḥ tiśavdarāśīti yoginyārṇavī vāgviśuddhā 
śivāsiddhivāgeśvarī mātṛkāsiddhimicchā kriyā maṅgalāsiddhi lakṣmīrvibhūtiḥ 
saṃbhūtirgatiḥ śāśvatākhyānti nārāyaṇīraktacaṇḍākalālekṣaṇābhīmarūpā 
mahocchuṣmayoge priyātvaṃ jayatsyājitā rudra saṃmohinītvaṃ navātmākhya devasya 
cotsaṃgayā nāśritāmantramārgānugairmantribhirvīrapānānu raktaiḥ subhaktauśca 
saṃpūjyase devī pañcāmṛtaiddivyapānotsavai muṇḍakaṃ kārakāpālinī ekajanma 
dvijanmatrijanmacatuḥ pañca ṣaḍsaptajanmobhaivaistaiśca nānaiḥ śubhaiḥ 
phalguṣaistarghasemadyamāṃsa priyemantra vidyāvratī bhāśibhirmuṇḍakakāla 
kāpālibhirdirvyacaryā nuruḍhai namaskāra oṃkāra svāhā svadhākāra vauṣaṭ vaṣakāra 
hūṃkāra phaṭkārajātibhiretaiśca
<p. 12> mantrākṣarocāribhirvā mahastasthitai rakṣasūtrāvali jāpibhiḥ sādhakaiḥ 
putrakaiḥ rmātṛbhirmaṇḍalaiddīkṣitai yogibhiryoginīvṛndamelāpakai rudrakrīḍārasaiḥ 
pūjyasayoginīyogasiddhipradedevītvaṃ padmapatropamaillocanaiḥ snehapūrṇestu 
saṃpaśyase tasyadivyāntarikṣasthitā saptapātālasaṃkhecarī siddhidevyā hatāvartane 
bhaktitoyaḥ paṭheddaṇḍakaṃme ekakālaṃdvikālaṃ catuḥpaṃca ṣaḍsaptacāṣṭau 
śuciḥ sasmaredyaḥ sadāmānavaḥ sopicaurāgniśastrārṇave parvatāgrepi saṃrajyasedevī 
putrānurāgān mahālakṣmīpriye hemacaurānyadārānu śaktaśca vrahmaghna 
mahādoṣaduṣṭāvimuñcanti saṃsmṛtya devī tvaṃdīyaṃ mukhaṃ pūrṇa 
candrānukāre sphuraddivyamāṇikya satkuloghṛṣṭha gaṇḍasthalaṃ ye'pivadvādṛḍhai 
vandhanainnāgapāśai bhujāvarddhapādāṃgulaistepitvaṃ nnāma saṃkīttanārdevi 
muñcantighoraimmahāvyādhibhiḥ saṃsmṛtya pādāravinda dvayante 
mahākālikālāgnitejaḥ prabheskanda vrahmendracandrārka puṣvāyudhai molimālāli 
satpadmakiñjalkasatpiñjare sarvavīrāmvike bhairavibhairasteśara nāgatohaṃ 
kṣamasvāparādhaṃ (2) śive || 
<p. 13> evaṃ stutvā mahādevi bhairavena mahātmanā | 
tato liṅgaṃ vinibhadre nirgatāṃ parameśvarī || pañcavaliḥ || 
aiṁ (5) mayūrāsanāya pādukāṃ || 
aiṁ (5) śrīṁ hrīṁ kulaputravaṭukanāthāya pādukāṃ || valiḥ || 
aiṁ (5) narāsanāya pādukāṃ || 
aiṁ (5) thrauṁ prastaradvīpa dambhakīdevī mahādhvāṃkṣa kṣetrapālāya pādukāṃ || 
aiṁ (5) śavāsanāya pādukāṃ || 

