ghamoghaṃ cāmuṇḍā kaulamārge kulakamalamaya 
kaulinī koṅkaṇākhyā ākhyātā vāmamārge prakaṭitanilayālinī vindudehā || 
oṃ kāre maṇḍale vā akulamayā yognicakre pratiṣṭhā 
śrīnāthotsaṃgagāmā pravaramunigaṇe 
carcitā bhīmamūrtiḥ sā devī lokamātā 
śivasakalamukhāpātu śrīnātha cakre | 

<p. 26a> śrīkaṇṭhābhyarcāmānā ca turyagasahitā madhyaliṃge nvikākhyā 
pīṭhasthā purayantī cakacakitakalā kaulamārgoditābhā | 
nāmnā śrīkuvjikākhyā tripathagatiyutātryikṣe 
rātriprakārātān devīṃ naumi bhaktyā 
prakaṭitanilayā pañcakādyanta bhinnā | 
kālīkaṃ kālarūpā kalitatararavā bhīṣaṇī bhakṣayantī 
sā me śrīkuvjikāmvā prakaṭayatu mahājñānadivyaughamoghaṃ || 

<p. 26b> hrīṁ glūṁ hrīṁ slūṁ hrīṁ plūṁ hrīṁ mlūṁ hrīṁ nlūṁ hsauṁ hsphreṁ śrīṁ hrīṁ aiṁ || 
ṛddhiṃ dehi siddhi dehi jñānaṃ dehi āyurddahi dhanaṃ dehi dhānyaṃ dehi lakṣmīṃ 
dehi imāṃ valiṃ gṛhna (2) amṛtāvedya svāhā || 
samastamantrapīthe || ukānuktaṃ || kṣamasva varado mama svāhā || 
yajamānanatriyāñjalicchāyake || mūlamantrana || 3 || vālaḥ || ṣaḍaṃgapūjā || 
āvāhanādi || dhenumudrā yonimudrā darśayet ||

<p. 27a> nirvāṇacchāya || valiḥ || tvākamahāvalina dhunake || āvāhanādi 
yonivindumudrāṃ darśayet || 
valisacatasindhara akṣata svānataya || dhūpa || 
dīvyagandhasamāyuktaṃ sarvadeva priyāruhāḥ | 
āghrāyaḥ sarvadevānāṃ dhūpo 'yaṃ pratigṛhyatāṃ || 
dhūpāhāreṣu bhagavan viśvarūpa maheśvara dhūpenāne deveśī suprītāṃ 
parameśvarī || dīpa || 

suprakāśamahātejaḥ sarvatra timirāpahaṃ | 

<p. 27b> savāhyāntaraṃ jyotiddīpoyaṃ pratigṛhyatāṃ || moho nihaya || 
vindu nahāyasalimelāyāduvane sārakocoyāva mohānihaya || 
cet sindharataya svānataya || māhonisa pūjāyāya || aiṁ (5) padmāsanāya namaḥ || aiṁ (5) 
śkṣmlvryīṁ śrīḍoṣadhī karmabhaṭṭārikāyai pādukāṃ || 3 || 
mūlamantra na triyāñjali || śaṁ mahālakṣmī saṃhārabhairavāya pādukāṃ || 
ṣaḍaṃga || māṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || miṁ sirase svāhā ||

<p. 28a> mūṁ śikhāya vauṣaṭ || maiṁ kavacāya huṃ || mauṁ netratrayāya vaṣaṭ || maḥ 
astrāya phaṭ || āvāhanādi || mudrā || naivyadyaḥ || 
annamahorasaṃdivyaṃ  raśeṣadbhi samanvitaṃ | 
mayāniveditabhaktyā gṛhāna parameśvarī || 
naivyadya gṛhyatāṃ devī bhaktime ca parāṃ kuru apamṛtyu haraṃ devī paratre ca parāṃ 
gati || japa || trideva || thrauṁ svāhā (10) || śrīṁ hrīṁ svāhā || glauṁ svāhā || thavamārayāya || 
smlvryūṁ svāhā (10) || nirvānayāhako yāya || idaṃ japaṃ gṛhānaṃ svāhā || 
svānadevaske cchāya || japa svānaviya || 

<p. 28b> (1) maṇḍala dayake || ke vā (5) vātaya || stotra || 
aiṁ (5) akhaṇḍamaṇḍalākālaṃ vyāptaṃ yena carācaraṃ | 
tatpadaṃ darśitaṃ yena tasmai śrīguruve namaḥ || 
śrī mahābhairavāya || 
śrīdevyuvāca || 
śrīsaṃvartāmaṇḍalānte kramapadanihitānandaśakti subhīmāsṛṣṭaṃ nyāyacatuṣkaṃ 
akulakulagataṃ pañcakaṃ cānyaṣaṭkaṃ | 
catvāraḥ paṃcakonyaṃ punarapicaturaṃ ṣoḍaśājñāviśeṣo devyāstau mūrtimadhyeha 
sakhaphalakarāvindupuṣpākṣa mudrā || 
vṛrddhaṃ kaimālavāraṃ paramaśivakalācakra devī kramānyā śrīnāthaṃ 
candrapujyā navanavakalitaṃ yugma bhede tu sāraṃ ||

<p. 29a> tritatvaṃ siddhāvatāraṃ prathamakaliyuge koṅkaṇesvādhikāraṃ teṣāṃ vai 
putraśiṣyā navapurakhagamate teṣumadhyedi raṣṭau || 
santānaṃ gotrapiṇḍaṃ kulakamasakalaṃ ṣoḍaśāntā kramāntaṃ 
ādauddhemaṇḍalādyai paribharalamalaṃ pūjyasat bhāvavṛndaṃ || 
ādhāvasthā daśāntaṃ kulakramasakalamaṇḍalasthānapūrvaṃ saṃskāraṃ 
trikṣematatpaśu janabhayakṛdvindusiddhi śivāgnau || 
madhye viśrāma bhūmi prabhavamanubhaya pratyayaṃ svādhikāraṃ saṃsṛṣṭaṃ yena 
tasmai namatuguruvaraṃ bhairavaṃ śrīkujeśaṃ || 
aiṁ yāsāśaktirbhagākhyā tripathagatiyutā trikṣarātriprakārā aiṁ tasyā śrīoḍiyāne 
parakarasahitaṃ madhyesaṃsthaṃ sudīptaṃ || 

<p. 29b> hrīṁ tacchrī jālaṃdharākhya prakatitanilayadakṣiṇe caiva koṇe śrīvāme 
śrīpūrṇapīthe paśujanabhayakṛtpūjitaṃ yenaviśvaṃ || 
hsphreṁ tasyāgrekāmarūpaṃ madanakaliyutaṃ sarvasiddhālayaṃ ca hsauṁ trikoṇānte 
samastaṃ paramaśivakalālaṃ kṛtaṃ yogavṛndaṃ | 
hyauṁ tanmadhye divyaliṅgaṃ paramasuṣakaraṃ vindurūpaṃ ṣarūpaṃ klīṁ 
nityānandasvarūpaṃ tadupariparamaṃ ṣaprakārairvibhinnaṃ || 
glūṁ vidyābhogāpagamya manubhayavimaraṃ triśapīṭhe lalāṭe aiṃ avaṃ vyāptaṃ 
samastaṃ sthitilayajananī rudraśaktitribhedā ||
 
<p. 30a> aiṁ tatasthā devadevī akulakulamayānandadhā trisvarūpā oṃ gurvājñā 
vindubhūtāyaśujanaharaṇī siddhidivyogha rūpā || 
hsauṁ nityaklinnā suraktā bhagamudita padānandadhātriprasirddhā kṣmauṁ kurvantī 
tatvakāmāṃ kṣubhitavaranuṃ śrījākṣānnamāmi || 
santānaṃ merumārgena anvayaṃ tratra devatā || 
nirgamaḥ pīṭha oṃkāraṃ siddhāṃnvaya prakīrtitā || 
bhūṣṇībhūtīguhāvāsī vṛkṣaścaiva kadamvakaḥ | 
saṃkhetasyavitaṃ proktaṃ amvā ca guhavāsinī || 
gṛheścandrapuraṃ proktaṃ bhedomanthāna bhairavaṃ | 

<p. 30b> gotra amalikādevī vāmamārge pralpayat || 
anvayaṃ pratyayaścāra madhikāraśca koṅkaṇe | 
janmavrahmaśirāsthāne sthitiśrīkāma rūpake || 
kīrtiściñcinivṛkṣa tu siddhicaiva tu śāgare | 
tuṣṭāhaṃ tasya deveśi yojānāti kulākramaṃ || 
ṣoḍaśādhāra bhedena nyāsaṃ kuṭaṃ kramaṃ tathā || 
pūjitaṃ siddhidaṃ bhadre suśiṣyāya nivedayet || 
oṃ namo'stute mahāmāya sūkṣmadehe parāpare | 
ekākiniviśvadhātmānādākhyavindu mālinī || 
adehāyasamutpanne acareviśva dhāriṇī || 
mahākuṇḍalani nityaṃ haṃsamadhye vyavasthitā || 

<p. 31a> somasūryāgnimadhyesthe vyomavyāpi parāpare | 
oṃkāravigrahāvasthai hakārārdhārdha dhāriṇī ||
vālāgraśatadhāsūkṣme antecākṣayavyaya |
hakārārddhakalādhāre padmakiñjalkamāśrite ||
sakalākhye mahāmāye varadeloka pūjite | 
ekaikanādi madhyesthe marmamekaika bhedinī ||
aṣṭatriṃśat kalādevī bhedinī brahmarandhrake ||
vidyullatānibhā devī bhujaṃ kuṭilākṛti ||
vrahmāviṣṇuśca raudraśca īśvaraśva sadāśivaḥ |
etapañcamahā pratāpādamūle vyavasthitā || 
trailokyajananī devī namasteśakti rupiṇī ||

<p. 31b> iḍāpiṅgalamadhyesthe mṛṇāratantu rupiṇī ||
umākhyehṛgate gaurī dvādaśāditya varcase |
sūnyesūnyāntārāvasthehaṃ sākṣaprāṇa dhāriṇī ||
lamvākhya paramādevi dakṣiṇortara gāminī ||
nāsāgre ca samuttīrṇe madhyesūtra pravāhiṇī ||
hallekhe parmānande tālamuddhi vyavasthitā ||
nādaghaṇṭhika saṃghṛṭe guṇāṣṭaka samanvite ||
sthūle sūkṣmetva saṃkrūrddhe dharmādharma putadvaya |
kāryakāraṇakatṛtvaṃ triśūnyanā vigrahe || 
parāparapareśu caitanyaśāśvate dhruve | 
sarvavarṇadharī devī guhyatatva triviśrute || 
śaktimūle mahāvyuhe vinduvijasamanvite |
<p. 32a> aśarīre mahābhāge saṃsārārṇava tāriṇī ||
jayā ca vijayā caiva jayantī cāparājitā |
tumvuruvījamadhyesthe namastepāpa mocanī ||
vandhamokṣavarī ṣoḍaśāntā vyavasthitā |
ḍamanī śaktiśūla na mahāvyuhe samanvite ||
bhamanī bhāmaṇī gaurī māyāyaṃtra pravāhinī ||
svacchanda bhairavī devī krodha unmarta bhairavī ||
pañcāsavarṇarūpa sthātvayā rudrāḥ prakīrtitāḥ |
amṛtākhye ruruścandra namastejñāna bhairavī ||
daṃṣṭrotkaṭo vidyujihvetālakākṣī bhayānane |
namāmi devadeveśī aghoreghora vikrame || 
<p. 32b> jvālāmukhī vegavatī umādevī namostute ||
yoginī ca śrayādevī gaurīlakṣmīsarasvatī ||
haṃsasvarādhake devī gomukhī śakti mālinī ||
kroṣṭakī śubhagādevī durgākātyāyanīstathā ||
nityaṃ klinnā samākhyātā raktā ekākṣarāparā |
vrāhminī hanī māheśvarī caiva kaumārī vaiṣṇavī tathā ||
vārāhī caiva māhendrī cāmuṇḍātvaṃ bhayānanā ||
yogeśītvaṃ hi deveśi kulāṣṭaka vibhūṣite ||
aṣṭāṣṭaka dharīdevī lakṣmītvaṃ vahurūpiṇī ||
aindrī caiva tu āgneyāṃ yāmyāṃ ṛtyavāhiṇī ||
vāyuvyāṃ caiva kovalī iśāne ca mudrā hṛtā |
<p. 33a> prayāgā varuṇā kolā aṭṭahāsa jayantikā ||
caritre kāmrakaṃ caiva devī koṭaṃ tathā kramaṃ |
tathā kālī umādevī devadūti namostute ||
bhadrakāli mahāmāyā carmamuṇḍā bhayāvahe |
mahośūkṣme mahāsānte namasteśakti rūpiṇī ||
bhurbhuvasvati svāhānte dayānārthaṃ kurukṣame |
jñānāthito mahāmāya etardikṣāmivedituṃ ||
yastvidaṃ paṭhyate stotraṃ trisaṃdhyāṃ caiva mānavaḥ |
prāpnoti cintitā kāmān strīṇāṃ bhava tu vallabhaḥ ||
iti śivaśaktisamarasatvaṃ mahāmāyā stotraṃ samāptaṃ ||
<p. 33b> piṅgākṣiraktakeśāṃ kiṇikiṇidhavaraṃ kiṅkiṇī mālajālaṃ draṣṭrāsyaṃ 
krūlabhāvaṃ sakalabhayaharaṃ pātrahastaṃ ca nādaṃ ||
suvyaktaṃ siṃhanādaṃ la la la la la valaṃ varcanaṃ vyomatatvaṃ bhūtapretādināthaṃ 
grahagaṇanamitaṃ kṣatrapālaṃ namāmi ||
raktāmvalaṃ jvalitapiṅgajatākalāpaṃ jvālāvali ratirathaḥ dadharapracandraṃ || 
sūryādayāt kanekakānta na saṅgagauragaurīsutaḥ vaṭukanātha mahaṃ namāmiḥ ||
hantārṣākṣota dukhaṃ samita bhavabhayaṃ sarvavighnāntakāya gāṁ gīṁ gūṁ gaiṁ 
khaḍaṃgegagaṇagatigate siddhisarvārtha bhāve |
<p. 34a> oṃ hrūṁ mudrā gajākhyagasapavanagate āyānekasasthe oṃ hrīṃ hūṃ hāṃ gāṃ 
gaṇesedviradaviṣagaṇevighnināthaṃ namaste ||
icchājñānī kriyā sāsuravaranamitā sāśriyāmaṅgalākhyā sāgaurī sā ca durgā 
bhagavati sudhā mātṛkā carmamuṇḍā |
sā vrahmā sā ca viṣṇū grahagaṇanamitā bhairavī kṣetrapālā sānekarūpā 
vividhaguṇadayā goginītvāṃ namāmi ||
ūkāro nityapādoha sakṣamalabhujocodaraścāgniliṅgaṃ vāyuvyāghrāṃ jināka 
śaśisakalaśiro vindunādorddha yukte ||
<p. 34b> nirjiṅgaṅgāvudhārā ṛjuparamakarā bhairavomantramurtiḥ pāyādevonavātmā 
sakalaguruvaraṃ bhairavaṃ śrīkujeśaḥ ||
vrahmāṇīkamalendu saumyavadanī māheśvarī lilayā kaumālī ripurdarpanāsanakarī 
cakrayudhā vaiṣṇavī | 
vārāhī ghanaghoraghaghanamukhī aindrī ca vajrāyudhācāmuṇḍā 
gananāthabhairagaṇārakṣantume mātṛkā ||
madhye trisāsanasthā madamuditamukhī vrajrapadmosudīptā vrahmāṇyāṣṭe patre 
svaradikapraṇame śrīprayāgādīkṣetre |
yuktāstā viṃśakonavasaṣasahasake vajraśṛge sphuranti sāṣṭāviṃśāti bhedā 
kramakulanugatāpā tu dvātriṃśavarṇāḥ ||
<p. 35a> khaḍgamvāmantrasiddhiṃ parapuravisanaṃ khegati rocanamvā śastrestambhaṃ 
ripurṇāṃcalipaliṭha jayaṃ staṃbhanaṃ sarvavidyā ||
dīrghāyukṣaṃ cacitvaṃ nidhirasagutikā pādukā kāmasiddhi sarvānetrādadantu 
alipisitaratā bhairave nānuraktā ||
śyāmāraktā trinetrā stanabharaṇamitāmatta mātaṅgagāmi vimvoṣṭhī cārunetrā 
pṛthutarajaghanā mekhalāratnasobhet ||
devāṅge vastrasobhevaravarakumevarvare keśabhāresāme śrīkuvjikākhyā vitaratutara 
sājñānadivyaughamogha ||
<p. 35b> utphullāmvujakarṇikoparigatā śrīsiddhilakṣmī parā karpūra sphaṭikendukundu 
dhavalā |
niśeṣapāpopahā |
saṃsārārṇavaduḥkhapaṃkadahanī niṣkaṃpanaṃ sarvadā śrīmatpañcamuṣāmvujā 
daśabhujāpretasthitā pātuvaḥ ||
yāsāntakāgni kuharosthitibhāsvarūpāṃ somārkavahni tripathodalamadhye saṃsthā |
ciccetarintaviṣayāṣya vilīnarūpāṃ svābhāvabhāvanti paramāṃ praṇamāmikālī ||
aindrasaivasarāsanasyadadhatī madhyelalāṭe prabhāsauṁ klīṁ kāntimanuṣṇagaurī 
vasirasyātanvatī sarvataḥ |
<p. 36a> eṣā sau tripurāhṛdi dvitirivoślāsosadādasthita |
cchindyādva sahasāpadaistibhirūghaṃ jyotirmayīvāhnmayī ||
māyā kuṇḍalanīkriyā madhumatīkālīkalāmālinī mātaṅgīvijayājayā bhagavatīdevī 
śivāśāmbhavī śaktiḥ karavallabhā trinayanivāgvādinī bhairavīhrīṁ kālitripurā 
parāparamayīmātā komālityasi ||
mahālakṣmīmahādevī saubhāgye surasundarī ||
vaiduryapādukārūḍhā siṃhāsanopari sthitā ||
<p. 36b> caturbhujāṃ viśālākṣī kaḍgapheṭaka dhāriṇī |
nūpurahārakeyūrā ratnakuṇḍaladhāriṇī ||
ratnotkhacitasarvāṅgī cūḍāmaṇi vibhūṣitā |
vicitrapuṣparatnañca vastragandhānu lepinī ||
trailokyevyāpinīdevī sarvasthaṃ sacarācaraṃ ||
siddhigandharvanamitā vidyādharasurārcitā ||
devīkoṭe mahāplakṣaṃ saṃhārāṣṭa kulakramaṃ |
īśānapīthasaṃsthāya mahālakṣmī namostute ||
saundaryasārarūcirāṃ kamalāyatākṣīṃ pīnastanī lalitahārasu śobhamānā |
khaḍgatriśūlavaradābhaya pāṇirūpāṃ lakṣmīṃ namāmiśirasā mahanīñcamurtiṃ ||
<p. 37a> jathāvāṇaprahārāṇāṃ kavacaṃ bhavatu vāraṇaṃ tadvadevavidhātrānāṃ 
śāntibhavatuvāranaṃ ||
svasthānakṣetrapālāya vrahmāṇyādi aśitāṅgamahābhairava sahitāyagaṇavaṭu tu 
yoginī kṣetrapālāsāṅgālāya sagaṇasyarivārāya digavidigi indrādilokapālāya 
suprītāvaradābhavantu ||
yajamānasya sagaṇasyarivārāṇāṃ  āyurārogyamaiśvaryā janadhanalakṣmī 
santatisantānavṛddhirastu yathā śāstrotraphalavaradāyano bhavantu || 
anyatrasaraṇaṃ nāstitvamevaśaraṇaṃ mamaḥ tasmāt kāruṇya bhāvena rakṣarakṣa 
parameśvarī || gvayadakṣiṇā || namaskā || tarpaṇa || prītipretā ||
<p. 37b> mahādīpadadyakeyā vidhiḥ || hvathukohnu ṛlusiyāya || ekabhaktayāya || saṃti 
ācāryayā ṛlusiyāya || vastrahere || yajamānasucī vastrahere || pūjāju (1) 
paṃcopacālajorana || sūryakāntisavyāḍhāmataṃ dayake || paripu (1) garbhataya || 
hyāḍhuakṣata gautraḍhā (5) || paṃcaratna luḍhohomuti gharāvanaputra || lepanayāvāsala || 
nāsāka aguḍikapurakasturikāthapale śrīkhaṇḍaraktacandanagāthavanaphūlakuṃkuma || 
śvateniyāvapaṃcaratnahyāḍhu akṣatagva (5) ||
mahādīpayācosatayā vatāle ||
<p. 38a> vethānethe || mivakothetule || mahādīpayolakṣaṇa || yajamānayājavalāhātana || 
mahādīpayātalasa || mla (1) hyāḍhu akṣata || lukṣakotatayāvapotraceyāvataya || kṣetrā 
itātrapu (4) ghe lasavulāvataya || valiyāta || bhujāvanagva (1) || nyalāne utaśca (1) || khālapāta 
(10) || ne utapu (10) || naivedyamāla || kuśahāmala || ācārya || yajamāna nehyaṃ pūjāvane || 
devayā anukramana pūjādyāya || dhūpadīpa || jāpa || stotra || aṣṭapatrapadmacoyāva || 
khāśitaya || khāśiḍhoyake khālapāta (10) ||
<p. 38b> pātacchi vali || aghapātrahvavanetaya || mahādīpa pūjāyāye || tritatve nācamya | oṃ 
hrāṁ ātmatatvāya svāhā | oṃ hrīṁ vidyātatvāya svāhā | oṃ hrūṁ śivatatvāya svāhā || 
gurunamaskāra || 
aiṁ (5) akhaṇḍamaṇḍalākāraṃ vyāptaṃ yena carācaraṃ | 
tatpadaṃ darśitaṃ yena tasmai śrīguruve namaḥ || 
gururvrahmāgururviṣṇu gurudevamaheśvaraṃ | 
gurudeva jagatsarvaṃ tasmai śrīguruve namaḥ || 
(5) paramagurūbhyo namaḥ || (5) parameṣṭhi gurubhyonamaḥ || (5) paramācārya 
gurubhyonamaḥ || śrīādideva pādukāṃ ||
<p. 39a> padmāsanāya pādukāṃ || kūrmāsanāya pādukāṃ || ātmāsanāya pādukāṃ 
| oṃ hraḥ agnaya strāya phaṭ || 
aiṁ (5) huṁ phaṭ vajrapañjale svāhā || calamakule kulamacale hrīṁ hraṁ phaṭ svāhā || 
nyāsa | oṃ hraḥ agni astrāya phaṭ || kalaśodhanaṃ | 
oṃ hrāṁ agnayakaniṣṭhikāya namaḥ | oṃ hrāṁ agnaye anāmikāya namaḥ | 
oṃ hrāṁ agnayamadhyemāya namaḥ | oṃ hrāṁ agnayetarjanyāya namaḥ | 
