vīreśvarī mahāvīravīrabhasma vibhūṣitāṃ |
trailokyāṃ karṣaṇī devī siṃdūrāruṇa murtamaṃ || svāna ||
nānāpuṣpa sugandhāni mālatī kusumodayaṃ |
saubhāgyaṃ siddhidaṃ bhadre puṣpārohaṇa mūrtamaṃ ||
syākantaṃ yatāceta svānaviyā nyāsaḥ ||
<p. 47b> saṁ astrāya phaṭ || kalaśodharaṃ || 4 || māṁ kaniṣṭhāya namaḥ || mīṁ anāmikāya 
namaḥ || mūṁ madhyemāya namaḥ || maiṁ tarjanyāya namaḥ || mauṁ aṃguṣṭhāya namaḥ || 
maḥ astrāya phaṭ || māṁ hṛdayāya namaḥ || mīṁ śirase svāhā || mūṁ śikhāya vauṣaṭ || 
maiṁ kavacāya huṁ || mauṁ netratrayāya namaḥ || maḥ astrāya phaṭ || pūjanaṃ || hrauṁ 
śāttyātitakalāya namaḥ || modasa || hraiṁ śāntikalāya namaḥ || nūśvaḍasa || hūṁ 
vidyākalāya namaḥ || techusa || hrīṁ pratiṣṭhā kayāya namaḥ || liṃgasa || hrāṁ nivṛrti 
kalāya namaḥ || cchugoḍasa || lomavilomana pūjā ||
<p. 48a> ṣaḍaṃgena pūjanaṃ || avahnasvarotejodrāva || gāyatrī || 
uṁ paśupāśāya vidmahe viśvakarmāyadhī mahetanno jīva prayodayāt || 
vindunahāyāva dugusamayanake || kaṃgolalaṃ khajodvāvataya || adyādi || cānya || 
paśuṃ gṛhnāsi devesi daśyayā upavācitaṃ | 
asyāpi svargasaṃprāpti māheśvarī prayacchame || mūhā nadvāvatyāvake | 
mahālakṣmī mahādevī saubhāgya surasundarī | 
vaidurya pādukā rūḍhā siṃhāsano paristhitā || 
caturbhujā viśālākṣī khaḍga pheṭaka dhāriṇī | 
nupurahāra keyūrāratnakuṇḍala dhāriṇī |
<p. 48b> ratnotkhacita sarvāṅgī cūḍāmaṇi vibhūṣitā ||
vicitrapuṣparatnañca vastragandhānu lepinī ||
trailokya vyāpinī devī sarvasthaṃ sacarācaraṃ |
siddhigandharva namitā vidyādhara surārcitā ||
devīkoṭe mahāplakṣaṃ  saṃhārāṣṭa kulākramaṃ |
īśānapīṭha saṃsthāya mahālakṣmī namostute || astra || arghapātra nahāya || 
śiracchedana yācake || thamajodvāvahinati cakre || śiracchāya || iti paśujāṃga vidhiḥ || 
samayacchāya || hyutasamayaviya || samayajodvāva || tarpaṇa || 
prītaḥ pretāsanacchā bhavatu viharaṇo bhairavā mantra mūrtiścaṇḍī caṇḍāsanasthā 
praṇati sphaṇiphalārlokapālā phaṇīndrāḥ |
<p. 49a> yakṣā ṛkṣāśva daityāḥ pibhṛgaṇa sahitā mātarāḥ kṣepālā yogi 
nyāryāgayuktā jalavalakhacalāḥ pānametat pivantu || pivantu devatāḥ sarveḥ 
